From: Native WinApps <rubinot@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] wined3d: disable ARB_SYNC to force APPLE_FENCE on macOS

O glClientWaitSync (ARB_sync) do driver GL da Apple falha sob Rosetta com
GL_INVALID_OPERATION, gerando um loop de erro que travava a renderização
do WebView2 (Chromium) — bug 59370 do Wine.

Remover a entrada GL_ARB_sync da tabela de extensões faz o wined3d cair
no caminho APPLE_FENCE (glTestFenceAPPLE), que funciona no macOS.

Aplicar em: dlls/wined3d/adapter_gl.c (Wine 11.0/11.20)

--- a/dlls/wined3d/adapter_gl.c
+++ b/dlls/wined3d/adapter_gl.c
@@ -125,7 +125,7 @@
     {"GL_ARB_stencil_texturing",            ARB_STENCIL_TEXTURING         },
-    {"GL_ARB_sync",                         ARB_SYNC                      },
+    /* PATCH: ARB_SYNC desabilitado para forçar APPLE_FENCE no macOS */
     {"GL_ARB_tessellation_shader",          ARB_TESSELLATION_SHADER       },
